  "summary_en": "Peru's National AI Strategy 2026-2030 sets a human-centred, risk-aware framework for governing and managing AI nationally. It defines governance roles (SGTD, AI Officers), and four axes: talent and capacities, innovation and entrepreneurship, ethical and regulatory framework, and citizen participation, with a roadmap and monitoring. No robotics-specific content.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Objective: strengthen national AI governance and management for inclusive, safe, ethical use respecting human rights.",
