   "Creates roles such as AI Officers (OIA) reporting to the Digital Government and Transformation Committee and SGTD.",
   "Public dashboard of indicators and biennial strategic review aligned with OECD and APEC.",
   "Person-centred, risk-management approach aligned with UNESCO and OECD instruments."
